pted and dropped members in the publication verifier.\n- Prepare the primary checkout without discarding local history. Require every unpublished commit's paths and modes to satisfy the existing passive-telemetry policy before synchronization.\n- Invoke the existing train synchronously, preserving its combined CI, claims, leases and post-push checks. Keep the individual-PR path and number-only standalone train callers, and provide a concrete deployment patch and activation instructions.\n- Runtime activation and the first live batch remain downstream of independent review and merge.\n\n### Testing\n- Repair commit `c55a406975d6b17ec4a92f993fc6d76105439d42` passed normal commit hooks: 741 tests with 9 skipped in 250.352 seconds.\n- Nine adapter tests, eight selected train scenarios and the dropped-pin verifier regression passed. They cover a requested A followed by green B, changed-and-reverted nontelemetry history, temporary executable telemetry mode, unchanged pins, conflict drops and standalone callers.\n- The worktree is clean and fifteen handoff artifact hashes were verified. The active runtime scripts remain unchanged.\n- New-head CI and a fresh bounded F1/F2/integration recheck of review 5244965776 are pending. No daemon activation or live train has run.\n\n---\nAddresses #593\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T06:10:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T07:10:54Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Foundational definitions, shared APIs, or supporting layers", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595/commits", "review_comments_url": "